{"name":"Sundown","hex":"#f5c99e","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sundown","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Sunset.","A hat with a wide brim to shade the eyes from sunlight."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To experience an episode or an onset of some detrimental mental condition like agitation, anxiety, hallucination or dementia, daily at the approach of nightfall."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sundown"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sundown, Queensland (Southern Downs Region)","blocks":[{"text":"Sundown is a rural locality in the Southern Downs Region, Queensland, Australia. It is on the Queensland border with New South Wales. In the 2021 census, Sundown had \"no people or a very low population\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Red_Rock_gorge._Sundown_National_park_%285672478416%29.jpg/330px-Red_Rock_gorge._Sundown_National_park_%285672478416%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sundown%2C_Queensland_(Southern_Downs_Region)","wikidata":"Q42842779"},{"title":"Sundown National Park","blocks":[{"text":"Sundown is a national park in Sundown, Southern Downs Region, Queensland, Australia, 250 kilometres (160 mi) southwest of Brisbane. The park contains spectacular gorge country and a number of peaks higher than 1,000 metres (3,300 ft)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Sundown_National_Park_3.jpg/330px-Sundown_National_Park_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sundown_National_Park","wikidata":"Q1641217"},{"title":"Sundown (2021 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Sundown is a 2021 drama film written and directed by Michel Franco. It stars Tim Roth, Charlotte Gainsbourg and Iazua Larios. The plot follows a wealthy man (Roth) who attempts to abandon his family on vacation after the death of his mother. The film had its world premiere at the Venice Film Festival on 5 September 2021, and was released in the United States by Bleecker Street on 28 January 2022. The film was met with generally positive reviews."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/ca/Sundown_%282021_film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sundown_(2021_film)","wikidata":"Q107650846"},{"title":"Sundown (Gordon Lightfoot song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Sundown\" is a song by Canadian folk artist Gordon Lightfoot, from the titular album, released as a single in March 1974."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d3/Sundown45.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sundown_(Gordon_Lightfoot_song)","wikidata":"Q7639816"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Sundown_smelter_ruin%2C_1998_02.png/500px-Sundown_smelter_ruin%2C_1998_02.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Sundown_smelter_ruin%2C_1998_02.png/500px-Sundown_smelter_ruin%2C_1998_02.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Sundown smelter ruin, 1998","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASundown_smelter_ruin%2C_1998_02.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Tim_Roth_Cannes_2014.jpg/500px-Tim_Roth_Cannes_2014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Tim_Roth_Cannes_2014.jpg/500px-Tim_Roth_Cannes_2014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATim_Roth_Cannes_2014.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Charlotte_Gainsbourg-5